{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06636","headline":"贻王处士子文 · 储光羲","name":"贻王处士子文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春草生洞渚，春风入上林。\n春臯有黄鹤，抚翮未扬音。\n王屋尝嘉遁，伊川复陆沈。\n张弦鵾鸡弄，闭室蓬蒿深。\n避地歌三乐，游山赋九吟。\n大君思左右，无乃化黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}